      "message": "+1 - I agree with the feedback here but seems reasonable to do in follow-up CL since the native value has been defined a long time and is used in a few places.\n\nPerhaps we can file a follow up bug to track? (I am happy to file the bug, PLMK if any concerns on this approach, William)",
      "parentUuid": "7ff1b9d8_b4a8faa2",
