      "writtenOn": "2023-09-14T07:06:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry, I didn\u0027t provide full context. I observed BT stack keeps reconfiguring LE scan parameters during inquiry because the preconfigured LE scan parameters by BT framework were different from the configuration of BT stack. I thought it is not intended behavior. Please check the details in b/294160434#comment42.",
      "parentUuid": "a73fe437_f4888c7e",
      "revId": "28aa7aa04a68abad92592ec5fa5bd148d3d343d0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
